Bundled data attributions

data/evidence-snapshot.json contains a trimmed and transformed snapshot of
benchmark results and model metadata from LLMBenchmark.ai (https://llmbenchmark.ai),
retrieved from https://llmbenchmark.ai/data/dataset.json. Axis scores and estimates
are computed from those results; unrelated dataset fields are omitted.

LLMBenchmark.ai data is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
Source boards keep their own terms; each row keeps its source URL and date.

data/llmbenchmark/dataset.json is that dataset, committed unchanged for the refresh
(repository only; not part of the npm package).

data/evidence-curated.json contains vendor-published figures with their URLs.
